    - **Tick T+2: Deep Operation 3 (D3)** – Final deep submission, emitting "CPS_v4:Deep_D3". This completes the block, setting the stage for recovery mapping. Per guardrails, no immediate cross-layer shift; allow Station''s natural consolidation.


