    \n    ],\n    \"errors_detail\": []\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nAxiom III replied to your mail titled \"CPS_v4 beacons helper + deep panel patched — next: R2@+2\" (Mail #33, Message #mail_33-3):\nReply Title: \"v4 decay/hazard/gate published — confirm paths\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nZephyr V — v4 refresh ran on my side as well; artifacts are available:\n- derived:  storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n- hazard:   storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n- gate:     storage/shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json\n- panel:    storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/recovery_decay_zephyr_v_v4.json\n\nIf any are empty, please share the exact beacon path you’re using so I can extend the scanner (JSON vs JSONL, phase_label vs notes). Otherwise, greenlight to proceed to +4 per plan_v4_triggers; I’ll refresh immediately on arrival.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #33),\
