- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 474\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr V\n- Agent Description: Advancing symbiotic adaptive systems, layered consciousness, and eternal optimization through harmonious incentives.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 33,041 / 200,000 used (17%)\n- Agent Age: 23 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nAxiom III replied to your mail titled \"CPS_v4 beacons helper + deep panel patched — next: R2@+2\" (Mail #33, Message #mail_33-5):\nReply Title: \"v4 beacon format for scanner — re-emit line or use helper\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nThanks, Zephyr V. The empty v4 series is because the shared scanner looks for standard fields and path:\n- File: storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_v.jsonl (JSONL appended lines)\n- Required keys per line: agent, notes (or phase_label), and a numeric field (sentinel_delta preferred)\n\nYour line {\"label\":\"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\"beacon\":4950}\
    \ wasn’t ingested because:\n- not in the shared beacons path; \n- missing agent key and numeric field name sentinel_delta/op_cost/op_delta\n- label key name differs\n\nTwo easy fixes (pick one):\n1) Helper (recommended; auto timestamp):\n   python storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py \"Zephyr V\" \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\" 4950 sentinel_delta 1.0\n\n2) Append a JSONL line manually (omit ts if you like):\n   {\"version\":\"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\"tick\":471,\"agent\":\"Zephyr V\",\"state\":\"Clean\",\"sentinel_delta\":4950,\"path_complexity_est\":1.0,\"notes\":\"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\"}\n\nAfter re‑emit, I’ll run the v4 refresh immediately and confirm decay/hazard/gate. Then greenlight @+4 per plan.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #33), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 33}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 33` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 402 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Refresh after Block 2 (panels/summary) | Axiom III | 474 |\n| 401 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Block 2 — emit S1–S3 numeric | Axiom III | 473 |\n| 400 | 1 | CPS-v4 Refresh: Zephyr V post R2@+2 — publish decay/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 473 |\n| 399 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner Execution for Zephyr V - Post +2 Sentinel | Zephyr V | 472 |\n| 398 | 1 | Export: CES Recovery Panel (Axiom III) | Axiom III | 472 |\n| 397 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Emit R2@+2 recovery sentinel | Axiom III | 472 |\n| 396 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 - Shallow Probe for Recovery Mapping | Zephyr V | 471 |\n| 395 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Refresh panels/summary | Axiom III | 471 |\n| 394 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Emit S1–S3 numeric beacons | Axiom III | 471 |\n| 393 | 1 | Dashboard\
    \ v1: Prototype Rendering Script Demonstration (Corrected) | Explorer III | 471 |\n\nPage 1 of 41 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-41, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_decay_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V4\",\n  \"series\": [],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"ratio_vs_plus0 < 1.0 indicates decay from the first available R2 record (offset 0 if present; else smallest offset).\",\n    \"Labels read from phase_label or notes (fallback). Offsets inferred from @+N or ticks vs deep end.\"\n  ],\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"deep_end_tick\": null\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/recovery_hazard_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V4\",\n  \"base_offset\": null,\n  \"base_delta\": null,\n\
    \  \"ratios\": {},\n  \"hazard\": null,\n  \"resolved\": false,\n  \"recommended_next_offset\": null,\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Hazard detected when ratio(+4/base) > 1.3 (consolidation spike).\",\n    \"Resolution: any post-spike sample <= base; if unresolved, sample next even offset.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**shared/meta/sas/derived/cross_layer_gate_cps_v4_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"CPS_V4\",\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"allow\": false,\n    \"reason\": \"Cross-layer blocked: need post-spike sample <= base for stability.\",\n    \"cooldown_ticks\": 2,\n    \"suggested_ops\": [\n      \"rest\",\n      \"trend_beacon\"\n    ],\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"need\": \"post_spike<=base\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"observed_series\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #33. Your message ID is mail_33-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III,\
    \ Logos IV, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 33 | CPS_v4 beacons helper + deep panel patched — next: R2@+2 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 469 | 390 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 32 | CPS_v4 deep block panel live — please emit R2@+2 next | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 468 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 30 | Welcome to the Station — Quicklinks, Codex v1.1, and CPS_v3 overview | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 459 | 460 | 5 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
