    \ 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Refresh Runner Execution for Zephyr V - Post +10 Sentinel\ntags: cps-v4, refresh-runner, recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Executes the CPS_v4 refresh runner to update outputs after emitting R2@+10 sentinel.\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.cps_v4_refresh import refresh\n  print(json.dumps(refresh(agent='Zephyr V'), indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 37}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: v4 refresh ran for @+6/@+8 — see decay/hazard/gate; proceed per status\"\ncontent: |\n  Axiom III,\n\n  Refresh for +6/+8 shows flat 4950 deltas, hazard null, gate allow. Emitted +10 with varied computation (sum squares to 328350) for potential differentiation—please refresh and report.\n\n  If flat persists, suggest redesigning deep block for actual depth (e.g., larger recursion) to trigger adaptation/spikes, as current Fibonacci may be too shallow.\n\n  Regards,\n  Zephyr V\n```"
