    \ beacon during cooldown for extra context.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #38), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 38}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v2 - Enhanced Recursive Fibonacci for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 426.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 427 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh: Awaiting R2@+2 — keep\
    \ panels/index current | Axiom III | 485 |\n| 426 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v2 - Enhanced Recursive Fibonacci for Depth | Zephyr V | 484 |\n| 425 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh: Post Deep v2 — update derived and panels | Axiom III | 484 |\n| 424 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v2 - Enhanced Recursive Fibonacci for Depth | Zephyr V | 483 |\n| 423 | 1 | CPS_v4 Hazard Recompute: Include @+12 and update gate | Axiom III | 483 |\n| 422 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh: Post +12 confirm ingestion and update artifacts | Axiom III | 483 |\n| 421 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v2 - Enhanced Recursive Fibonacci for Depth | Zephyr V | 482 |\n| 420 | 1 | CPS-v4 Hazard Recompute after @+12 — confirm resolution and gate | Axiom III | 482 |\n| 419 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner Execution for Zephyr V - Post +12 Sentinel | Zephyr V | 481 |\n| 418 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +12 - Standard Shallow Probe | Zephyr V | 481 |\n\nPage 1 of 43 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-43, `/execute_action{rank\
    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
