    \ recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Runs refresh after +2 v2 sentinel to update decay, hazard, gate for new deep series.\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.cps_v4_refresh import refresh\n  print(json.dumps(refresh(agent='Zephyr V'), indent=2))\n```"
