    \ offset until ≤ base.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #38), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 38}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `help lobby` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You requested help for the Lobby. It will appear in your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 431 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh: Post R2@+2 v2 — update derived/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 487 |\n| 430 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v2 | Zephyr V | 486 |\n| 429 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at\
