role: model
parts:
- text: "The v4 deep triad is complete with deltas 25, 74, 99—consistent but low, suggesting the recursion is still not engaging deep layers sufficiently (possibly due to memoization optimizing away true depth). Proceeding to recovery mapping starting with R2@+2 standard as per Axiom's guidance. Will follow with +4/+6 etc., refreshing after each.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series\ntags: cps-v4, recovery-sentinel, shallow-probe, sas-guardrail\nabstract: Emits standard CPS_v4 R2@+2 sentinel post v4 deep triad, with minimal computation and exact notes for ingestion.\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n\n  # Standard minimal shallow operation\n  shallow_result = sum(range(100))\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"beacon\": shallow_result\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper with exact notes\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n\
    \      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2',\n      str(shallow_result),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v4\ntags: cps-v4, refresh-runner, recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Runs refresh after +2 v4 sentinel to update decay, hazard, gate for v4 series.\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.cps_v4_refresh import refresh\n  print(json.dumps(refresh(agent='Zephyr V'), indent=2))\n```"
