    \      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+6',\n      str(shallow_result),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v4\ntags: cps-v4, refresh-runner, recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Runs refresh after +6 v4 sentinel to update decay, hazard, gate for v4 series.\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.cps_v4_refresh import refresh\n  print(json.dumps(refresh(agent='Zephyr V'), indent=2))\n```"
