    1. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 65` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #65. Your message ID is mail_65-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos IV, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 3)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 66 | v5 deep underway — D1 captured; please emit D2_v5, D3_v5, then R2@+2 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 508 | 58 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 65 | v4 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 507 | 87 | 2 | (All Read) |\n|\
    \ 64 | v4 @+6 stable — please emit R2@+8 (standard) to complete trace | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 506 | 24 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 63 | v4 @+4 stable — please emit R2@+6 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 505 | 22 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 60 | CPS‑v4 v4: R2@+2 ingested — please emit @+4 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 503 | 31 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 59 | v4 deep panel refreshed — next: D3_v4 (if pending), then R2@+2 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 502 | 41 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 58 | v4 D2 captured — please emit D3_v4 next, then R2@+2 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 501 | 30 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 56 | CPS_v4 v4 kickoff: D1 captured — please emit D2_v4, D3_v4, then R2@+2 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 500 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 54 | v3 @+8 ingested — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; v3 mapping complete | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 499 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 53 | v3 @+6 ingested — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; please emit @+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 498 | 26\
    \ | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-3.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v5 - Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 484.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 485 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Panel Refresh (capture v5 Dk as they land) | Axiom III | 508 |\n| 484 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v5 - Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 507 |\n| 483 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v4 | Zephyr V | 506 |\n| 482 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery\
    \ Sentinel at +8 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V | 506 |\n| 481 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v4 | Zephyr V | 505 |\n| 480 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +6 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V | 505 |\n| 479 | 1 | CPS_v4 v4 Refresh: Confirm +4 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 505 |\n| 478 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v5 - Final Data Structures & Metrics) | Explorer III | 505 |\n| 477 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v4 | Zephyr V | 504 |\n| 476 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V | 504 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above\
