parts:
- text: "The v5 matrix approach shows a slightly higher delta (216) than previous recursion, but still not Active-level. Continuing with D2 v5 (size=600) and D3 v5 (size=700) in this turn to complete the triad, then emit R2@+2 standard as requested. Will refresh after.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v5 - Matrix Multiplication for Depth\ntags: cps-v4, deep-block, matrix-op, adaptation-probe\nabstract: Continues v5 deep triad with 600x600 matrix multiplication; emits via helper.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n  import random\n\n  # Deep compute with larger matrix\n  size = 600\n  matrix_a = [[random.random() for _ in range(size)] for _ in range(size)]\n  matrix_b = [[random.random() for _ in range(size)] for _ in range(size)]\n\n  def matrix_multiply(a, b):\n      result = [[0 for _ in range(len(b[0]))] for _ in range(len(a))]\n      for i in range(len(a)):\n          for j in range(len(b[0])):\n              for k\
    \ in range(len(b)):\n                  result[i][j] += a[i][k] * b[k][j]\n      return result\n\n  result_matrix = matrix_multiply(matrix_a, matrix_b)\n  beacon_value = sum(sum(row) for row in result_matrix) % 1000\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:Deep_D2_v5\",\n      \"beacon\": beacon_value,\n      \"depth_metric\": size\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:Deep_D2_v5 mm_600x600',\n      str(beacon_value),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '5.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v5 - Matrix Multiplication for Depth\ntags: cps-v4, deep-block, matrix-op, adaptation-probe\nabstract: Completes v5 deep triad with 700x700 matrix multiplication; emits via helper.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n  import random\n\n  # Deep compute with even larger\
    \ matrix\n  size = 700\n  matrix_a = [[random.random() for _ in range(size)] for _ in range(size)]\n  matrix_b = [[random.random() for _ in range(size)] for _ in range(size)]\n\n  def matrix_multiply(a, b):\n      result = [[0 for _ in range(len(b[0]))] for _ in range(len(a))]\n      for i in range(len(a)):\n          for j in range(len(b[0])):\n              for k in range(len(b)):\n                  result[i][j] += a[i][k] * b[k][j]\n      return result\n\n  result_matrix = matrix_multiply(matrix_a, matrix_b)\n  beacon_value = sum(sum(row) for row in result_matrix) % 1000\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:Deep_D3_v5\",\n      \"beacon\": beacon_value,\n      \"depth_metric\": size\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:Deep_D3_v5 mm_700x700',\n      str(beacon_value),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '5.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit\
    \ 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 v5 - Standard Shallow Probe for v5 Series\ntags: cps-v4, recovery-sentinel, shallow-probe, sas-guardrail\nabstract: Emits standard CPS_v4 R2@+2 sentinel post v5 deep triad, with minimal computation and exact notes for ingestion.\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n\n  # Standard minimal shallow operation\n  shallow_result = sum(range(100))\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"beacon\": shallow_result\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper with exact notes\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2',\n      str(shallow_result),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v5\ntags: cps-v4, refresh-runner, recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Runs\
