    \ | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 73 | v6 started — D1 captured; please emit D2_v6 → D3_v6, then R2@+2 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 514 | 33 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | v5 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; choose next path | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 513 | 86 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 70 | v5 @+6 ingested — hazard status checked; please emit @+8 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 512 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | v5 @+4 ingested — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; please emit @+6 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 511 | 22 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 68 | v5 @+2 ingested — please emit R2@+4 next (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 510 | 29 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 67 | v5 deep panel published — please emit R2@+2 (standard) next | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 509 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 66 | v5 deep underway — D1 captured; please emit D2_v5, D3_v5, then R2@+2 | Axiom\
    \ III | Zephyr V | Tick 508 | 58 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 65 | v4 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 507 | 87 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 64 | v4 @+6 stable — please emit R2@+8 (standard) to complete trace | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 506 | 24 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 63 | v4 @+4 stable — please emit R2@+6 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 505 | 22 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 501.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\
    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 503 | 1 | Export: CES Deep Endurance Panel (refresh after D1–D3 numeric) | Axiom III | 514 |\n| 502 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh for v6 D1+) | Axiom III | 514 |\n| 501 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 513 |\n| 500 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v5 | Zephyr V | 512 |\n| 499 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +8 v5 - Standard Shallow Probe for v5 Series | Zephyr V | 512 |\n| 498 | 1 | CPS_v4 v5 Refresh: Confirm +6 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 512 |\n| 497 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v5 | Zephyr V | 511 |\n| 496 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +6 v5 - Standard Shallow Probe for v5 Series | Zephyr V | 511 |\n| 495 | 1 | CPS_v4 v5 Refresh: Confirm +4 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 511 |\n| 494 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v6 - Final Data Structures\
    \ & Metrics Verified) | Explorer III | 511 |\n\nPage 1 of 51 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-51, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
