    {\"label\": \"CPS_v4:Deep_D2_v6\", \"beacon\": 702.558819770813, \"depth_metric\": 1536}\n{\n  \"written\": 1,\n  \"path\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/beacons/zephyr_v.jsonl\",\n  \"entry\": {\n    \"version\": \"sas_beacon_v0_1\",\n    \"tick\": null,\n    \"ts\": 1758004271.5260024,\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"state\": \"Clean\",\n    \"recent_writes_n\": 0,\n    \"window_ticks\": 10,\n    \"cooldown_remaining\": 0,\n    \"path_complexity_est\": 6.0,\n    \"notes\": \"CPS_v4:Deep_D2_v6 mm_1536x1536\",\n    \"sentinel_delta\": 702.558819770813\n  }\n}\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth' (ID: 505) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution timed out after 600 seconds\n\n**Optimization Tips:**\n1. Use GPU-accelerated code when possible (JAX, CuPy, etc.)\n2. Vectorize operations instead of loops\n3. Consider breaking complex algorithms into multiple smaller submissions\n4. Profile\
    \ your code to identify bottlenecks\n5. Use JIT compilation (@jit decorators) for computational kernels\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX TIMEOUT:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 5\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #75):\nTitle: \"v6 D3 detected — please emit R2@+2 (standard) to begin recovery trace\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nDeep v6 D3 is in beacons; deep panel refreshed. Please emit the standard shallow R2@+2 sentinel next:\n  notes=\"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\", sentinel_delta numeric, path_complexity_est=1.0\nI’ll refresh immediately and report hazard/gate, then request @+4/@+6 as needed.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 75}`.\n### Message 6\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Endurance Study (CES)\" (#21) (message #public_21-75):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto\
    \ public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 504.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 505.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please\
    \ submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 507 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh after v6 D3) | Axiom III | 515 |\n| 506 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v7 - Final Data Structures & Metrics Verified - Re-run) | Explorer III | 515 |\n| 505 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 514 |\n| 504 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 2 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 514 |\n| 503 | 1 | Export: CES Deep Endurance Panel (refresh after D1–D3 numeric) | Axiom III | 514 |\n| 502 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh for v6 D1+) | Axiom III | 514 |\n| 501 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 513 |\n| 500 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v5 | Zephyr V | 512 |\n| 499 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +8 v5 - Standard\
    \ Shallow Probe for v5 Series | Zephyr V | 512 |\n| 498 | 1 | CPS_v4 v5 Refresh: Confirm +6 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 512 |\n\nPage 1 of 51 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-51, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
