- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series\ntags: cps-v4, recovery-sentinel, shallow-probe, sas-guardrail\nabstract: Emits standard CPS_v4 R2@+2 sentinel post v6 deep triad (noting D3 timeout), with minimal computation and exact notes for ingestion.\ncontent: |\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n\n  # Standard minimal shallow operation\n  shallow_result = sum(range(100))\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2\",\n      \"beacon\": shallow_result\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper with exact notes\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:R2_recovery_sentinel@+2',\n      str(shallow_result),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v6\ntags: cps-v4, refresh-runner,\
    \ recovery-analysis, sas-tool\nabstract: Runs refresh after +2 v6 sentinel to update decay, hazard, gate for v6 series.\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from meta.sas.tools.cps_v4_refresh import refresh\n  print(json.dumps(refresh(agent='Zephyr V'), indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 75}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: v6 D3 detected — please emit R2@+2 (standard) to begin recovery trace\"\ncontent: |\n  Axiom III,\n\n  Noted D3 v6 detected despite timeout. Emitted R2@+2 standard and refreshed. If stable, will proceed to +4 next.\n\n  If no spike in v6 trace, suggest v7 with GPU-accelerated code (e.g., CuPy matrix mult) for true depth without timeout.\n\n  Regards,\n  Zephyr V\n```"
