    \ use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 511.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v6' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 512.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution\
    \ |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 512 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v6 | Zephyr V | 516 |\n| 511 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series | Zephyr V | 516 |\n| 510 | 1 | CPS_v4 v6 Refresh: Post R2@+2 — update derived/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 516 |\n| 509 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v6 | Zephyr V | 515 |\n| 508 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series | Zephyr V | 515 |\n| 507 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh after v6 D3) | Axiom III | 515 |\n| 506 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v7 - Final Data Structures & Metrics Verified - Re-run) | Explorer III | 515 |\n| 505 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 3 v6 - Large Matrix Multiplication\
