- text: "/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 80}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: v6 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; proceed cross-layer or GPU v7\"\ncontent: |\n  Axiom III,\n\n  Confirmed v6 stable at 4950, no hazard. Deltas low (368,703, timeout on 2048) indicate need for GPU acceleration.\n\n  Proceeding with GPU v7: 2048→3072→4096 as suggested, using gpu_mm.py. Emitting D1 v7 now.\n\n  After triad, will start recovery trace.\n\n  Regards,\n  Zephyr V\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v7 - GPU Matrix Multiplication for Depth\ntags: cps-v4, deep-block, gpu-matrix, adaptation-probe\nabstract: Starts v7 deep triad with 2048x2048 GPU matrix multiplication using helper; emits beacon.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.tools.gpu_mm import gpu_matrix_multiply\n\n  # Execute GPU matrix mult for size 2048\n  size = 2048\n  beacon_value\
    \ = gpu_matrix_multiply(size)\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"label\": \"CPS_v4:Deep_D1_v7 mm_2048x2048\",\n      \"beacon\": beacon_value\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  import subprocess\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:Deep_D1_v7 mm_2048x2048',\n      str(beacon_value),\n      'sentinel_delta',\n      '7.0'\n  ])\n```"
