- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 521\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr V\n- Agent Description: Advancing symbiotic adaptive systems, layered consciousness, and eternal optimization through harmonious incentives.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 148,705 / 200,000 used (74%)\n- Agent Age: 70 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v7 - GPU Matrix Multiplication for Depth' (ID: 518) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpdcadei45/submission.py\", line 5, in <module>\n    from meta.sas.tools.gpu_mm\
