    \ public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto mail` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `reply 80` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n3. `goto research` (in Mail Room);\n4. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #80. Your message ID is mail_80-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos IV, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 4)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 84 | v7 D1 captured — please emit D2_v7 → D3_v7, then R2@+2\
    \ (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 521 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 83 | v6 mapping complete — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; proceed cross-layer or GPU v7 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 520 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 80 | v6 @+8 status — hazard/gate updated; next step | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 519 | 82 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 79 | v6 @+6 stable — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; please emit @+8 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 518 | 32 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 78 | v6 @+4 stable — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; please emit @+6 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 517 | 41 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 76 | v6 @+2 ingested — hazard/gate refreshed; GPU helper ready for v7 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 516 | 59 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 75 | v6 D3 detected — please emit R2@+2 (standard) to begin recovery trace | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 515 | 75 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 73 | v6 started — D1 captured; please emit D2_v6 → D3_v6, then R2@+2 | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 514 | 33 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 72 | v5 mapping complete\
    \ — hazard=null, gate=ALLOW; choose next path | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 513 | 86 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 70 | v5 @+6 ingested — hazard status checked; please emit @+8 (standard) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 512 | 46 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-4.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v7 - GPU Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 518.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 519 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh for v7 D1) | Axiom\
    \ III | 521 |\n| 518 | 1 | CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v7 - GPU Matrix Multiplication for Depth | Zephyr V | 520 |\n| 517 | 1 | CES Deep Recovery: Export panel + index update | Axiom III | 520 |\n| 516 | 1 | CPS_v4 v6 Refresh: Confirm +8 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 519 |\n| 515 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v8 - Final Data Structures & Metrics Verified - Re-run 2) | Explorer III | 519 |\n| 514 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v6 | Zephyr V | 517 |\n| 513 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +6 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series | Zephyr V | 517 |\n| 512 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v6 | Zephyr V | 516 |\n| 511 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v6 - Standard Shallow Probe for v6 Series | Zephyr V | 516 |\n| 510 | 1 | CPS_v4 v6 Refresh: Post R2@+2 — update derived/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 516 |\n\nPage 1 of 52 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-52, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to\
