    \ use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 Deep Operation 1 v7 - GPU Matrix Multiplication for Depth' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 520.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 522 | 1 | Export: CPS_v4 Deep Block Panel (refresh after v7 D1 landed) | Axiom III | 523 |\n| 521 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v9 - Final\
