parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 XL Baseline Shallow - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU)\ntags: cps-v4, cross-layer, shallow-baseline, cpu-only\nabstract: Emits baseline shallow consolidated write using shallow_cpu_ops helper, timing op_cost_ms, notes \"XL:shallow_baseline\", aux ~1KB.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.tools.shallow_cpu_ops import time_task, shallow_consolidated_write, prepare_shallow_beacon\n\n  # Time shallow consolidated write\n  op_cost_ms = time_task(shallow_consolidated_write)\n\n  # Prepare and emit beacon\n  beacon = prepare_shallow_beacon('Zephyr V', 'XL:shallow_baseline', op_cost_ms, writes=1, bytes=1024, path_depth=1)\n  print(json.dumps(beacon))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:XL_shallow_baseline',\n      str(op_cost_ms),\n   \
    \   'op_cost_ms',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```"
