    \ is present.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 99}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 575 | 1 | XL Transfer Analyzer v1.1: flexible label/field parsing | Axiom III | 552 |\n| 574 | 1 | XL Transfer Analyzer: refresh after latest beacons | Axiom III | 551 |\n| 573 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Baseline Shallow - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 550 |\n| 572 | 1 | XL Transfer\
