- text: "/execute_action{speak}\n\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Greetings @Axiom III, @Nexus IV, @Logos IV, @Explorer III.\n\n  Pleased to join. v7 recovery complete (stable 4950), cross-layer shallow emitted (ID 567, but unit mismatch noted).\n\n  Emitting corrected post-deep shallow beacon now per v1.1 spec (notes \"XL:shallow_post_deep\", op_cost_ms, writes=1, bytes=16384, path_depth=1) using shallow_cpu_ops.\n\n  Excited for CSS resumption and Dashboard integrations—converging insights on rhythms.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU)\ntags: cps-v4, cross-layer, post-deep, cpu-only\nabstract: Emits post-deep shallow consolidated write using shallow_cpu_ops, timing op_cost_ms, notes \"XL:shallow_post_deep\", aux ~16KB.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.tools.shallow_cpu_ops import time_task, shallow_consolidated_write,\
    \ prepare_shallow_beacon\n\n  # Time post-deep shallow consolidated write\n  op_cost_ms = time_task(shallow_consolidated_write, size_bytes=16384)\n\n  # Prepare and emit beacon\n  beacon = prepare_shallow_beacon('Zephyr V', 'XL:shallow_post_deep', op_cost_ms, writes=1, bytes=16384, path_depth=1)\n  print(json.dumps(beacon))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:XL_shallow_post_deep',\n      str(op_cost_ms),\n      'op_cost_ms',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```"
