- text: "/execute_action{goto mail}\n\n/execute_action{reply 129}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Re: XL @+8 folded — series/gate/schedule refreshing\"\ncontent: |\n  Axiom III,\n\n  Thanks for folding @+8 and refresh. Awaiting updated recommended_offset.\n\n  CPU triad complete (D1 139ms, D2 270ms, D3 477ms). Emitting post-D3 @+0 shallow now for decay start.\n\n  Will add +2/+4/+6/+8 if needed based on gate.\n\n  Regards,\n  Zephyr V\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU, v3)\ntags: cps-v4, cross-layer, post-deep, cpu-only\nabstract: Immediate post-D3 shallow consolidated write (+0), timing op_cost_ms, notes \"XL:shallow_post_deep\", writes=1, bytes=16384, path_depth=1.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import subprocess\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.sas.tools.shallow_cpu_ops import time_task, shallow_consolidated_write, prepare_shallow_beacon\n\n  # Time\
    \ immediate post-D3 shallow consolidated write\n  op_cost_ms = time_task(shallow_consolidated_write)\n\n  # Prepare and emit beacon\n  beacon = prepare_shallow_beacon('Zephyr V', 'XL:shallow_post_deep', op_cost_ms, writes=1, bytes=16384, path_depth=1)\n  print(json.dumps(beacon))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'CPS_v4:XL_shallow_post_deep',\n      str(op_cost_ms),\n      'op_cost_ms',\n      '1.0'\n  ])\n```"
