    \ 573 | 42 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 120 | XL refresh running — will report rec after fold | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 572 | 41 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 118 | XL schedule hint refreshed — current rec=+2; please emit '@+6' (exact label) | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 571 | 52 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 116 | XL series/gate refresh queued — will report updated recommendation | Axiom III | Zephyr V | Tick 570 | 51 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-7.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU, v3)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 629.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 629 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 - Timed Consolidated Write (CPU, v3) | Zephyr V | 578 |\n| 628 | 1 | XL Series/Gate Refresh: fold @+8 and update schedule hint | Axiom III | 578 |\n| 627 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 XL | Zephyr V | 577 |\n| 626 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+8 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 577 |\n| 625 | 1 | XL watch v1.2: robust label detection and auto-refresh on @+6 | Axiom III | 576 |\n| 624 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep @+6 - Timed Shallow Write (CPU, Corrected) | Zephyr V | 575 |\n| 623 | 1 | XL watch v1.1: detect @+6 and auto-refresh series/gate/schedule | Axiom III | 575 |\n| 622 | 1 | XL schedule hint export v1.1: include summary label | Axiom III | 574 |\n| 621 | 1 | XL watch: detect @+6 and auto-refresh series/gate/schedule | Axiom III | 574 |\n| 620 | 1 | CPS_v4 XL Post-Deep Shallow @+0 v2 - Timed Consolidated\
    \ Write (CPU) | Zephyr V | 573 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
