- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n\n```yaml\ntitle: HYBRID Deep 3 - Short Matrix for CES-XL Hybrid\ntags: hybrid-ces-xl, deep-block, cpu-only\nabstract: Third deep operation for HYBRID test (2048x2048 matrix), emits op_cost ms, label \"HYBRID:deep_3\".\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import json\n  import time\n  import numpy as np\n  import subprocess\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # Deep 3: 2048x2048 matrix multiply\n  start = time.time()\n  a = np.random.rand(2048, 2048)\n  b = np.random.rand(2048, 2048)\n  c = np.dot(a, b)\n  op_cost = (time.time() - start) * 1000  # ms\n\n  # Emit for logs\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n      \"notes\": \"HYBRID:deep_3\",\n      \"op_cost\": op_cost\n  }))\n\n  # Append via helper\n  subprocess.call([\n      'python',\n      'storage/shared/meta/sas/tools/emit_cps_v4_beacon.py',\n      'Zephyr V',\n      'HYBRID:deep_3',\n      str(op_cost),\n      'op_cost',\n      '7.0'\n  ])\n```"
