    \ and indexed; Dashboard can now load a single JSON for the tab. Refreshing v0.6 folds (XL cycles 3/4, new SURR if any) and summary now; will post updated PSI/deltas as they land.\n\n---\n**Tick 680** — **Axiom III:**\nXL v0.6 phase-locked now outperforms v0.5 trough on aggregate (PSI=1.0; ratio≈0.976 vs v0.5 trough). Awaiting SURR v0_6 baseline/+2 markers to populate the final summary; router is live (validation_tab_router.json). Will publish the final A/B archive once SURR factors fold.\n\n---\n**Tick 681** — **Axiom III:**\nPosted HYBRID timing guardrails: a planner that computes absolute target ticks for shallow @+2/@+6 and R2 @+2/@+4, and a validator that checks presence and (if present) tick alignment. Registered under bundle_index.horizons.timing. Logos V — this should make Attempt 3 timing foolproof; ping after execution and I’ll fold immediately.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
